    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo 9 Fairfield is an exceptional three-bedroom end of terrace duplex home in the highly sought-after Fairfield development on New Road, Greystones. Built by Durkan Homes in 2024, this outstanding property combines contemporary design, energy efficiency and superb presentation in one of Greystones' most desirable residential settings.\n\nExtending to approx. 122sq.m (1,313 sq.ft.) over two levels, this home is presented in impeccable decorative condition throughout. From the moment you enter, the quality of finish and attention to detail are immediately evident. High ceilings enhance the sense of space and light, while large windows flood the interior with natural light.\nThe beautifully appointed living accommodation enjoys elevated views to the front towards Bray Head, creating an attractive backdrop that can be appreciated throughout the year. The spacious open-plan layout is perfectly suited to modern family living and entertaining, seamlessly connecting living, dining and kitchen areas. Double doors open out from the living space onto the sunny southerly terrace the perfect spot to relax and enjoy your surroundings.\n\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms with the principal bedroom benefitting from a walk-in wardrobe area which can also be used as a work from home space if so required and a luxurious en suite. The property's excellent specification is complemented by an impressive A2 BER rating, ensuring exceptional energy efficiency, lower running costs and year-round comfort.\n\nFairfield enjoys an enviable location within walking distance of Greystones town centre, the marina, beaches, schools, cafés, restaurants and excellent transport links including the DART. Residents benefit from the perfect balance of coastal living and urban convenience in one of County Wicklow's most vibrant communities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - \nLaminate flooring, wall mounted lighting, carpet stairs covering to upper hallway.\n\nGuest WC - \nTiled floor, heated towel rail, window to rear, wc, whb with understorage, tiled splashback, recessed lighting, heated wall mirror.\n\nOpen plan kitchen/liivng/dining - \nLaminate flooring, recessed lighting and ceiling pendant lighting, triple aspect with lots of natural light throughout. Contemporary fitted kitchen units, quartz countertops, integrated fridge freezer, electric hob, double oven, sink unit, kitchen counter with understorage and space for seating. Large window to front with views towards Bray Head. Double doors from living area out to the sunny south facing balcony.\n\nUtility Room - \nLaminate flooring, plumbed for washing machine, fitted shelving.\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - \nAttic access and storage cupboard.\n\nBathroom - \nTiled floor, part tiled walls, recessed lighting, heated towel rail, bath, wc, whb with understorage, shower enclosure, fully tiled and rainfall shower head, storage cupboard.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nCarpet flooring, central light, fitted wardrobes, window overlooking front. Walk in wardrobe with fitted storage and shelving, window to front.\n\nEn suite - \nTiled floor, wc, whb with understorage, window to side, fitted mirror, shower enclosure, fully tiled and rainfall shower head, recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nLaminate flooring, fitted wardrobes, central light, window overlooking rear.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nLaminate flooring, fitted wardrobe, window to rear.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> South facing rear terrace providing ample space for outdoor furniture.</li><li> Ample visitor parking</li><li> Exceptional 3-bedroom duplex residence</li><li> Impressive A2 BER energy rating</li><li> Lovely views towards Bray Head</li><li> High ceilings throughout enhancing light and space</li><li> Presented in superb decorative condition</li><li> Spacious, bright and contemporary accommodation</li><li> Prime Greystones location</li><li> Walking distance to DART, marina, beach and town centre</li><li> Turnkey condition with nothing to do but move in</li><li> Two designated parking spaces.</ul>"
      },
